.ph::after{transition:opacity var(--t-soft) var(--ease-out)}

/* ═══════════════════ MOTION ═══════════════════
   TRIPLE-GATED. Every hidden-until-revealed state requires `html.js`
   (scripts actually ran) AND motion-OK AND an actual screen — print gets
   the whole page, revealed or not. No JS → this block's .js selectors
